# plant.fk: the kickoff's world-3 nuclear plant (Rory's, captured 2026-10-18), assembled and running
# from the start, and the pole line that ties its grid to the base's. Both are Literals of the
# kickoff's own capture (plant-w3.json): the plant block, and the chain of poles from its west side
# to the starter kit. Inside the world plot they are the plot's own entities, so you may move,
# extend or rebuild around them.
reactor = Literal<file="plant-w3.json", box="-34,-39,-17,-23"> @(0, 0)
bridge  = Literal<file="plant-w3.json", box="-22,-22,8,10">    @(12, 17)
